    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUESS RIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the finger total (the hand sum, if you will) in this game of intuition. Play your hand carefully, because there\u2019s more than just the win at stake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/1e27242ee754e92c13fb33c82267ca0a.poster.avif?t=1753821585\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/1e27242ee754e92c13fb33c82267ca0a.webm?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/1e27242ee754e92c13fb33c82267ca0a.mp4?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE POWERUPS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never face a battle of wits alone. Randomly assigned powerups will give you the upper hand as you play each new round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/963f713e6288611eca8498ac20e35b35.poster.avif?t=1753821585\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/963f713e6288611eca8498ac20e35b35.webm?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/963f713e6288611eca8498ac20e35b35.mp4?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your enemies fingerless to make your way up to the juror. You\u2019ll get your revenge and slip through their hands to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/49921c9abbe808baf87cc072be57fa29.poster.avif?t=1753821585\" width=500 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/49921c9abbe808baf87cc072be57fa29.webm?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/49921c9abbe808baf87cc072be57fa29.mp4?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a beautifully crafted claymation and stop-motion miniature set-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/1ca703322cd12fa60d555aab5491218b.poster.avif?t=1753821585\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/1ca703322cd12fa60d555aab5491218b.webm?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/1ca703322cd12fa60d555aab5491218b.mp4?t=1753821585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
